%%label II. Nocturne: Larghetto
%%note G major. A long melody for the violins over harp arpeggios, repeated with ornament by the flute; an agitated recitative in G minor; the melody returns, decorated.
X:1
T:Chopin’s Missing Symphony
T:II. Nocturne: Larghetto
C:Claude (AI), in the manner of Frédéric Chopin
M:12/8
L:1/8
Q:"Larghetto" 3/8=50
%%score [fl ob cl bn] [hn] harp [v1 v2 va vc cb]
% Original AI-composed homage. The score is written at sounding pitch.
V:fl clef=treble name="Fl. I, II"
V:ob clef=treble name="Ob. I, II"
V:cl clef=treble name="Cl. I, II"
V:bn clef=bass name="Bn. I, II"
V:hn clef=treble name="Hn. I–IV"
V:harp clef=treble name="Harp"
V:v1 clef=treble name="Vl. I"
V:v2 clef=treble name="Vl. II"
V:va clef=alto name="Vla."
V:vc clef=bass name="Vc."
V:cb clef=bass name="Cb."
K:G
V:fl
